## Docker

```bash
# Full clean restart (wipes DB + Redis):
docker compose down
docker volume rm yool-ai-plugin_postgres_data yool-ai-plugin_redis_data
docker compose build <service>
docker compose up -d

# Partial rebuild (keeps data):
docker compose build <service> && docker compose up -d <service>

# Reload nginx config without restart:
docker compose exec nginx nginx -s reload

# Watch logs:
docker compose logs -f <service>
```

Migrations run automatically on container startup via the migrations service.

---

## Running Tests

```bash
# Auth suite:
python test_auth.py

# Session service suite:
python test_session.py

# With custom base URL:
python test_auth.py  --base-url https://myserver.com
python test_session.py --base-url https://myserver.com
```

Always run `test_auth.py` after any change touching auth, shared models, or migrations.
Always run `test_session.py` after any change to `services/session/`.
